## API reference

### DropdownMenu.Root

<ApiTable props={rootProps} />

Item clicks close the menu; `CheckboxItem` and `RadioItem` stay open. Highlighted items carry `data-highlighted` for styling.

## Keyboard interactions

- <Kbd>↑</Kbd><Kbd>↓</Kbd> move focus and highlight; <Kbd>Home</Kbd> / <Kbd>End</Kbd> jump; type to search.
- <Kbd>Enter</Kbd> / <Kbd>Space</Kbd> selects; <Kbd>Esc</Kbd> closes one level; <Kbd>Tab</Kbd> dismisses.
- Submenu: hover or <Kbd>→</Kbd> opens, <Kbd>←</Kbd> closes.
